* The bankers in Mos Le'Harmless now face west by default.
* Items no longer vanish when dropped at the top of some stairs in Dorgesh-Kaan.

That's everything for this week's game update! We'd love to hear your feedback so please let us know what you think via our [http://services.runescape.com/m=forum/forums.ws?380,381,715,66213254 official forums], on the [https://www.reddit.com/r/2007scape/ 2007Scape Reddit], or the community-led [http://discord.gg/OSRS OSRS Discord] in the #gameupdate channel.

